<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-250 lbs    57.50-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Uneven, under 500 lbs 25-50 lower; over 500 lbs</p>
<p>25-50 higher. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    46.50-46.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    48.50-49.00</p>
</text>
